+The $\mathbf k$-resolved form in Eq. (49) is exactly the bulk specialization of the complete-energy-shell construction in Eq. (21). In a finite periodic normalization volume, translational invariance makes the velocity operator block diagonal in crystal momentum, so for a complete exact-energy shell
+\begin{equation*}
+P_\epsilon v_xQ_{\epsilon,\mathcal B}
+=\bigoplus_{\mathbf k}
+P_{\epsilon,\mathbf k}v_x(\mathbf k)Q_{\epsilon,\mathbf k,\mathcal B}.
