+The operator norm of this direct sum is the maximum of the finite-$\mathbf k$ block norms, which becomes the ordinary supremum in the bulk limit. Equation (49) therefore implements Eq. (21) without replacing a complete energy shell by a single momentum block, and it is not a pairwise $\max|v_{cv}|$ approximation. The distinction from an essential supremum matters formally even though it does not materially alter the present HgCdTe result.
 
